{"content_hash": "7fc50aac2532db60", "version_id": 334, "article_id": 34, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Author Correction: Histone Readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 Focus AID on Specific Loci", "title_zh": "作者更正：组蛋白阅读器 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 让 AID 精准定位", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11266-0", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1710447503692-8364152e431c?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8YXV0aG9yJTIwY29ycmVjdGlvbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkxNTUwMzAwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Benja Godin on Unsplash", "author": "Benja Godin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@benja_godin?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-person-writing-on-a-piece-of-paper-with-a-pen-SgZ6nWHi8FY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(212, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(250, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SCIENCE", "seed": "14846e897d91"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 259, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "A scientific paper in Nature has been corrected by its authors. The correction fixes the spelling of one researcher's surname. The original study was published on 30 September 2026.", "lead_zh": "《自然》杂志上的一篇科学论文被作者更正了。这次更正只修改了一位研究者姓氏的拼写。原论文发表于2026年9月30日。", "preview": "The journal Nature has published an author correction for a study that appeared on 30 September 2026. The original paper was titled \"Histone", "preview_zh": "《自然》杂志为一篇2026年9月30日发表的研究发布了一则作者更正。原论文的标题是《组蛋白阅读器 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 让 AID 集中在特定基因位点》。这类更正科学界很常见，通常用来修补一些小错误，并不会改变研究的主要结果。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 321, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/34/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 107.45, "size_bytes": 648576, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 316, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@09df8a5/content/data/versions/334.json", "paragraphs": ["The journal Nature has published an author correction for a study that appeared on 30 September 2026. The original paper was titled \"Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity\". Corrections like this are common in science, and they are used to fix small errors that do not change the main results of a study.", "According to the correction, the surname of one author, Marcelo A. Navarrete, was spelled incorrectly in the first version. It appeared as \"Navarrette\", with an extra letter. The mistake has now been fixed in both the HTML and PDF versions of the article, so readers can see the correct name.", "The study itself looks at how two proteins, called MLLT1 and MLLT3, work inside cells. These proteins are described as histone readers, which means they recognise chemical marks on histones, the proteins that package DNA. By reading these marks, they help to guide a molecule called AID to particular places in the genome.", "The research was carried out by a large team based mainly in Montreal, Canada. The authors are affiliated with the Institut de Recherches Cliniques de Montréal, the Université de Montréal and McGill University. One researcher, Diego Alvarez, also works at the Universidad de Magallanes in Punta Arenas, Chile.", "The correction does not change any of the scientific findings, and the study's conclusions remain the same. Three of the authors, Sophia Gannon, Kíra A. Häfner and Tim M. Gemeinhardt, contributed equally to the work. The corresponding author is Javier M. Di Noia, who can be contacted about the paper."], "paragraphs_zh": ["《自然》杂志为一篇2026年9月30日发表的研究发布了一则作者更正。原论文的标题是《组蛋白阅读器 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 让 AID 集中在特定基因位点》。这类更正科学界很常见，通常用来修补一些小错误，并不会改变研究的主要结果。", "根据更正说明，其中一位作者 Marcelo A. Navarrete 的姓氏在最初版本里拼错了，写成了 \"Navarrette\"，多了一个字母。现在这个错误已经在文章的网页版和 PDF 版里都改好了，读者能看到正确的名字。", "这项研究关注的是细胞内两种蛋白质 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 的工作方式。它们被称为组蛋白阅读器，意思是它们能识别组蛋白上的化学标记——组蛋白就是包裹 DNA 的蛋白质。通过读取这些标记，它们帮助把一种叫 AID 的分子引导到基因组中的特定位置。", "这项研究由一个大型团队完成，成员主要来自加拿大蒙特利尔。作者们分别隶属于蒙特利尔临床研究所、蒙特利尔大学和麦吉尔大学。其中一位研究者 Diego Alvarez 还在智利蓬塔阿雷纳斯的麦哲伦大学工作。", "这次更正没有改变任何科学发现，研究的结论也保持不变。有三位作者——Sophia Gannon、Kíra A. Häfner 和 Tim M. Gemeinhardt——对这项工作贡献相同。通讯作者是 Javier M. Di Noia，有关论文的问题可以联系他。"], "body": "The journal Nature has published an author correction for a study that appeared on 30 September 2026. The original paper was titled \"Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity\". Corrections like this are common in science, and they are used to fix small errors that do not change the main results of a study.\n\nAccording to the correction, the surname of one author, Marcelo A. Navarrete, was spelled incorrectly in the first version. It appeared as \"Navarrette\", with an extra letter. The mistake has now been fixed in both the HTML and PDF versions of the article, so readers can see the correct name.\n\nThe study itself looks at how two proteins, called MLLT1 and MLLT3, work inside cells. These proteins are described as histone readers, which means they recognise chemical marks on histones, the proteins that package DNA. By reading these marks, they help to guide a molecule called AID to particular places in the genome.\n\nThe research was carried out by a large team based mainly in Montreal, Canada. The authors are affiliated with the Institut de Recherches Cliniques de Montréal, the Université de Montréal and McGill University. One researcher, Diego Alvarez, also works at the Universidad de Magallanes in Punta Arenas, Chile.\n\nThe correction does not change any of the scientific findings, and the study's conclusions remain the same. Three of the authors, Sophia Gannon, Kíra A. Häfner and Tim M. Gemeinhardt, contributed equally to the work. The corresponding author is Javier M. Di Noia, who can be contacted about the paper.", "body_zh": "《自然》杂志为一篇2026年9月30日发表的研究发布了一则作者更正。原论文的标题是《组蛋白阅读器 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 让 AID 集中在特定基因位点》。这类更正科学界很常见，通常用来修补一些小错误，并不会改变研究的主要结果。\n\n根据更正说明，其中一位作者 Marcelo A. Navarrete 的姓氏在最初版本里拼错了，写成了 \"Navarrette\"，多了一个字母。现在这个错误已经在文章的网页版和 PDF 版里都改好了，读者能看到正确的名字。\n\n这项研究关注的是细胞内两种蛋白质 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 的工作方式。它们被称为组蛋白阅读器，意思是它们能识别组蛋白上的化学标记——组蛋白就是包裹 DNA 的蛋白质。通过读取这些标记，它们帮助把一种叫 AID 的分子引导到基因组中的特定位置。\n\n这项研究由一个大型团队完成，成员主要来自加拿大蒙特利尔。作者们分别隶属于蒙特利尔临床研究所、蒙特利尔大学和麦吉尔大学。其中一位研究者 Diego Alvarez 还在智利蓬塔阿雷纳斯的麦哲伦大学工作。\n\n这次更正没有改变任何科学发现，研究的结论也保持不变。有三位作者——Sophia Gannon、Kíra A. Häfner 和 Tim M. Gemeinhardt——对这项工作贡献相同。通讯作者是 Javier M. Di Noia，有关论文的问题可以联系他。", "text": "The journal Nature has published an author correction for a study that appeared on 30 September 2026. The original paper was titled \"Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity\". Corrections like this are common in science, and they are used to fix small errors that do not change the main results of a study. According to the correction, the surname of one author, Marcelo A. Navarrete, was spelled incorrectly in the first version. It appeared as \"Navarrette\", with an extra letter. The mistake has now been fixed in both the HTML and PDF versions of the article, so readers can see the correct name. The study itself looks at how two proteins, called MLLT1 and MLLT3, work inside cells. These proteins are described as histone readers, which means they recognise chemical marks on histones, the proteins that package DNA. By reading these marks, they help to guide a molecule called AID to particular places in the genome. The research was carried out by a large team based mainly in Montreal, Canada. The authors are affiliated with the Institut de Recherches Cliniques de Montréal, the Université de Montréal and McGill University. One researcher, Diego Alvarez, also works at the Universidad de Magallanes in Punta Arenas, Chile. The correction does not change any of the scientific findings, and the study's conclusions remain the same. Three of the authors, Sophia Gannon, Kíra A. Häfner and Tim M. Gemeinhardt, contributed equally to the work. The corresponding author is Javier M. Di Noia, who can be contacted about the paper.", "vocab": [{"word": "correction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "更正；订正", "note": "常指对已发表内容的小修改"}, {"word": "surname", "pos": "noun", "zh": "姓氏", "note": "比 last name 更正式"}, {"word": "spell", "pos": "verb", "zh": "拼写", "note": "spell incorrectly 表示拼错"}, {"word": "protein", "pos": "noun", "zh": "蛋白质", "note": "科学文章高频词"}, {"word": "histone", "pos": "noun", "zh": "组蛋白", "note": "包裹 DNA 的蛋白质"}, {"word": "genome", "pos": "noun", "zh": "基因组", "note": "指一个生物体的全部遗传信息"}, {"word": "affiliated with", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "隶属于；与……有关联", "note": "常用于介绍机构归属"}, {"word": "contribute equally", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "贡献相同", "note": "论文中说明作者共同贡献"}, {"word": "corresponding author", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "通讯作者", "note": "负责与外界联系的作者"}, {"word": "finding", "pos": "noun", "zh": "研究结果；发现", "note": "常用复数 findings"}, {"word": "conclusion", "pos": "noun", "zh": "结论", "note": "论文最后得出的判断"}, {"word": "locus", "pos": "noun", "zh": "位点；位置", "note": "复数形式为 loci，遗传学常用"}], "title_original": "Author Correction: Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity", "summary_original": "Nature, Published online: 08 October 2026;\ndoi:10.1038/s41586-026-11266-0\nAuthor Correction: Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity", "body_original": "Download PDF\nAuthor Correction\nPublished:\n08 October 2026\nAuthor Correction: Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity\nNoé Seija\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-2223-1291\n1\n,\n2\n,\nSophia Gannon\n1\n,\n3\nna1\n,\nKíra A. Häfner\nORCID:\norcid.org/0009-0008-1069-4647\n1\n,\n2\nna1\n,\nTim M. Gemeinhardt\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-0241-1009\n1\n,\n4\nna1\n,\nJana Ridani\n1\n,\n4\n,\nDiego Alvarez\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-0753-274X\n5\n,\nMélanie Provencher\n1\n,\n6\n,\nPoorani Ganesh Subramani\nOR